.TH reconcile 1  "reconcile " 
.SH NAME
reconcile \- Prepare semantic and physical histories for collaboration
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBreconcile\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fITARGET\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Prepare semantic and physical histories for collaboration
.PP
Reconcile computes a 3\-way merge between the workspace\*(Aqs local base and a target revision. This does not change the workspace\*(Aqs base automatically.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
.SH COLLABORATION
.TP
<\fITARGET\fR>
Target revision (can be an object ID or reference like @main)
